# one line ending for every agent and editor (Claude, Codex, Windows tools)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
# append-style logs: two branches adding lines at the top merge without a conflict (ADR 0013).
# After such a merge, check that no line appears twice (a row edited on both sides is kept in both versions).
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
art/REVIEW.md merge=union
*.jpg binary
